  "descriptionShort": "The share of all employed people who are paid employees of the public sector, including government, the armed forces, public services, and state-owned enterprises.",
  "descriptionFromProducer": "The proportion of public sector workers out of total employment.\n\nSource: World Bank staff calculations based on the methodology described in World Bank (2023). https://documents.worldbank.org/en/publication/documents-reports/documentdetail/099062623201028153/p1687031c943fa1313f6814bcf1aeb51371a5665a9ac",
